      "content": "thanks for that. can u go a bit deeper into the libertarian side though? i feel like that summary was a bit thin. like, what are the actual moral/philosophical theories they use to justify why taxation is \"coercive\"? i want to show my professor i actually understand the rigorous logic behind it, not just \"they want less taxes.\"",
